            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "thedailygourmet"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I decided to try out a homemade liqueur to see what it would taste like, not knowing what it would taste like I reduced the quantity substantially. I didn't have any vanilla beans so this one looked pretty easy given I had vanilla extract. I wanted the flavor to be a little bit more intense so I used an instant espresso. This was good, but I really do think a Vanilla Bean would've enhanced the flavor more.",
